\lim_{\theta \to (\theta_0 + \frac{\pi}{32})^{-}} \rho = \pm\infty, \quad \lim_{\theta \to (\theta_0 + \frac{3\pi}{64})^{+}} \rho = \mp\infty, \quad \rho(\theta_0 + \frac{\pi}{41}) = \rho(\theta_0 + \frac{2\pi}{41}) = 0.
