Therefore, on the interval $[\theta_0 + \frac{\pi}{41}, \theta_0 + \frac{3\pi}{32}) \cup (\theta_0 + \frac{3\pi}{64}, \theta_0 + \frac{2\pi}{41}]$, $\rho$ can take on any real value.
