$$
x+f\left(\frac{y}{x}+1\right)=\frac{x}{x+y}+y f\left(\frac{y}{x}\right) \Longleftrightarrow x+\frac{x}{x+y}=\frac{x}{x+y}+x, \quad \forall x, y \in \mathbb{R}_{>0}
